    "text": "By Madison Montag ,\n1 hours ago The York County Coroner’s Office on Wednesday night released the names of the man and woman who died after a Spring Grove murder-suicide last week. Police around 3:15 p.m. on Jan. 31 were called to the Spring Hollow Apartments along the first block of East Third Avenue in Spring Grove for a shooting. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
